1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,530
C.

2
00:00:01,530 --> 00:00:05,210
Millie and Daniel are talking about first aid.

3
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:10,970
Work in pairs and discuss what we should do to deal with emergencies.

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:15,395
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:15,395 --> 00:00:19,520
We may hurt ourselves when cooking.

6
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:24,880
Do you know what to do first if we cut ourselves? Sure.

7
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:28,560
First clean the wound. I see.

8
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:31,410
What should I do if it's bleeding?

9
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:40,180
Tie a clean piece of cloth round the wound and press it hard for 10 to 15 minutes.

10
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:43,950
What should I do if I can't stop the bleeding?

11
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:51,380
If it's serious, you should go and see a doctor right away. Alright, thanks!
